{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"skat-card-game UI copy.limits","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"skat-card-game.copy.limits","keys":["skat-card-game.copy.limits"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ini adalah permainan latihan tiga kursi biasa dengan dua CPU lokal, bukan multipemain online, turnamen, pertaruhan atau penyelesai permainan sempurna. Lelang adalah tangga latihan naik-turun, bukan dialog turnamen yang lengkap. Ini mendukung suit, Grand dan Null dengan dasar pickup/Hand, legalitas follow-suit dan poin deal. Buka/ouvert, Schneider/Schwarz yang diumumkan, hukuman turnamen dan aturan rumah tidak diimplementasikan.","record_id":"3101cddf48b11f892b91532822d76e00372b1f77574268dae5686ebc253293d1","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.0690698701250767,"source":"This is a casual three-seat practice game with two local CPUs, not online multiplayer, a tournament, gambling or a perfect-play solver. The auction is a streamlined ascending practice ladder, not the complete tournament dialogue. It supports suit, Grand and Null with pickup/Hand basics, follow-suit legality and deal scoring. Open/ouvert, announced Schneider/Schwarz, tournament penalties and house rules are not implemented.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"2eafca25eb46a598de4d0d9cf8c1671c366c2b53b759e136be77eb7b0cdd3832","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Ini adalah permainan latihan tiga kursi biasa dengan dua CPU lokal, bukan multipemain online, turnamen, pertaruhan atau penyelesai permainan sempurna. Lelang adalah tangga latihan naik-turun, bukan dialog turnamen yang lengkap. Ini mendukung suit, Grand dan Null dengan dasar pickup/Hand, legalitas follow-suit dan poin deal. Buka/ouvert, Schneider/Schwarz yang diumumkan, hukuman turnamen dan aturan rumah tidak diimplementasikan.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
